 with easy controls, giving a fun journey in a tricky place.", "short_description": "In Project Helix, you play as a happy, shiny ball in a colorful forest. Move with your controllers, bounce off walls for fun climbs, and jump high on bouncy trampolines. Then slide down twisty slides for an exciting ride. This VR game mixes nice looks with easy controls, giving a fun journey in a tricky place."}]}, "developer_name": "YourLocalLynx", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/project-helix-privacy-policy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "YourLocalLynx", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/project-helix/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9566815316738658"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822798_1856523358461803_1050633332193558651_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=an3d9IGXL6UQ7kNvwFrUaYf&_nc_oc=AdmOm_xbwtjV9kove0apZH13-441Zsr_arWoLXktFSz0No5Ka4URBxpA79bH44OeTz0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx3sZMVIbA43ePOLWBAya5TlHhUCMr6Rv1DAIbx1OoBIw&oe=69B3FE1A"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Project Helix", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {